    "text": "GENERAL WEATHER FORECAST FOR NEXT 36 HOURS",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      210.41,
      580.15,
      428.33,
      593.11
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 04.00 p.m. on 23 October 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328,
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      624.46,
      555.07,
      738.94
    ],
    "text": "The low-pressure area that was located near Sri Lanka is moving away from the island towards the west. A new low-pressure area has formed over the Bay of Bengal near the North Andaman Islands. The system is most likely to persist over the same region and intensify into a depression by 24 October 2026. Thereafter, it is very likely to move west-northwestwards and intensify further into a deep depression by 25 October and into a cyclonic storm over the west-central Bay of Bengal by the morning of 26 October 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      754.72,
      555.04,
      862.44
    ],
    "text": "Although this system is not expected to have a direct impact on Sri Lanka, an increase in rainfall is expected over the southwestern parts of the island during the next few days, as the wind flow associated with the system extends across the island. Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central, Northern, and North-western provinces and in Galle and Matara districts. Fairly heavy falls above 75 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      866.1,
      555.07,
      906.0
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      909.93,
      554.5,
      950.88
    ],
    "text": "Misty conditions can be expected at some places in Central and Uva provinces during the early hours of the morning.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
